@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
title Class structure — Mentor dashboard and roster
class MentorScope <<application service>> {
  +YouthIdsAsync(): IReadOnlyList<Guid>
  +CohortsAsync(): IReadOnlyList<MentorCohortRef>
  +CanSeeYouthAsync(childId): bool
}
class MentorDashboardHandler <<handler>> {
  +HandleAsync(): MentorDashboardDto
}
class MentoringHandler <<handler>> {
  +HandleAsync(): AssignedYouthDto
}
class MentorDashboardDto <<contract>> {
  +Youth: MentoredYouthDto[]
  +Cohorts: MentorCohortSummaryDto[]
  +CheckedInThisWeek: int?
  +RecentActivity: MentorActivityDto[]?
}
class MentoredYouthDto <<contract>> {
  +Id: Guid
  +Name: string
  +Age: int?
  +Programs: string[]
}
class MentorCohortSummaryDto <<contract>> {
  +ProgramId: Guid
  +Name: string
  +Term: string?
  +Role: string
  +YouthCount: int
}
class MentorActivityDto <<contract>> {
  +ChildId: Guid
  +YouthName: string
  +Kind: string
  +Session: string
  +At: DateTimeOffset
}
class YouthMentor <<entity, tenant-owned>>
class CohortMentor <<entity, tenant-owned>>
class AttendanceRecord <<entity, tenant-owned>>
class IModuleGate <<abstraction>> {
  +IsOnAsync(module): bool
}
MentorDashboardHandler --> MentorScope
MentoringHandler --> MentorScope
MentorDashboardHandler ..> IModuleGate : Roll Call on?
MentorDashboardHandler ..> AttendanceRecord
MentorScope ..> YouthMentor
MentorScope ..> CohortMentor
MentorDashboardHandler --> MentorDashboardDto
MentorDashboardDto *-- MentoredYouthDto
MentorDashboardDto *-- MentorCohortSummaryDto
MentorDashboardDto *-- MentorActivityDto
@enduml
